<title>THAILAND: Poonpipat Finance posts big Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>Poonpipat Finance posts big Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three and nine months ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)     (loss)   1.04	 vs    (profit)   0.50</p>
<p>    Net		(loss)  43.59	 vs    (profit)  12.37</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)     (loss)   0.72	 vs    (profit)   1.99</p>
<p>    Net		(loss)  30.24	 vs    (profit)  37.53</p>
<p>NOTES: Results are unaudited. Company's full name is Poonpipat Finance and Securities Plc, a finance and securities firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
